    "sentence_translations": [
      "More and More ...",
      "",
      "Ben: Lili, what shall we eat tonight?",
      "",
      "Lili: Anything’s fine.",
      "",
      "Ben: Then let’s eat pizza!",
      "",
      "Lili: Pizza again? We’ve had it three times this month already!",
      "",
      "Ben: Then what shall we eat?",
      "",
      "Lili: Anything’s fine.",
      "",
      "Ben: How about burgers?",
      "",
      "Lili: I don’t want to eat burgers either.",
      "I feel like even though I’ve been here for two months, I’m still not used to the food here.",
      "",
      "Ben: Then what exactly do you want to eat?",
      "",
      "Lili: Let’s cook at home tonight! Lately, I’ve gotten more and more used to cooking.",
      "",
      "Ben: Yeah! Compared to when we were living in China, your cooking is also getting more and more tasty.",
      "",
      "Lili: You are also eating more and more of it. Oh yeah, let’s go hiking and camping this weekend!",
      "",
      "Ben: Camping again tomorrow? We’ve already gone camping three times this month!",
      "",
      "Lili: Let’s go! I’m finding that I’m liking camping more and more!"
    ]
  }
